span.p:
Insufficient funds or daily limit: rolled back;
new transaction: failure_count + 1, stays ACTIVE,
notified once per day, retried next tick

POSTED or PENDING_REVIEW: next_run_date advanced,
or COMPLETED after the last occurrence;
failure_count reset; commit

DECLINED by fraud BLOCK: PAUSED FRAUD_BLOCK,
or COMPLETED if nothing is left;
audited, notified; commit

Analyst may clear the FRAUD_BLOCK
POST /fraud/scheduled-transfers/id/clear;
the customer must still resume it
